              <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-gray-700">
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#1E90FF] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                  3/8-inch nap paint roller with extension pole
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#1E90FF] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
                  4-inch chip brush for cutting in edges
                </li>
                <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-[#1E90FF] mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
